The project includes several screenshots demonstrating its functionality, including images of the globe in the [https://github.com/AodhanSweeney/climate_change_globe/blob/master/1910s.png 1910s] and [https://github.com/AodhanSweeney/climate_change_globe/blob/master/2010s.png 2010s]. A live version of the climate change viewer can be accessed at [http://students.washington.edu/aodhan/webgl_globe.html].

